        "spans": [
          {
            "kind": "context",
            "start": 13,
            "end": 1204,
            "text": "I’m building Ecom Sync Solutions, focusing on practical business automations and small technical fixes. I’m especially interested in the problems that seem small but become frustrating when they keep happening. For example: Form submissions not reaching Airtable or Google Sheets Webhooks receiving data but not updating the correct records Telegram notifications going to the wrong place or not arriving Duplicate records being created Email workflows not triggering reliably Data not syncing correctly between different services I’ve built and tested workflows involving website forms, Airtable, Google Sheets, Telegram notifications and email classification. I’m also open to reviewing smaller Make scenario issues involving these integrations, depending on the setup. I prefer starting with one clearly defined problem rather than rebuilding an entire system unnecessarily. If you’re dealing with something similar, feel free to reply with which tools you’re using, what should happen and what’s actually going wrong. We can discuss whether it’s something I can help fix and agree on a fixed price before starting. I’m available for remote projects and communicate through email or chat.",
            "sha256": "2d9c5d7bcc8791f39552aee082d3fbd1ab5ac819eca5aec0f7d682bc6569929f"
          }
